# T_SCRE: Items > Assemblies: the list of assemblies, the Parts tab of
# item 1 with its parts indented by level (deeper than the indent goes),
# Enter showing a part in the form and Esc walking back through the
# items shown before; then the second assembly's parts.
S ASSYLIST
K ENTER
S ITEM1
K ALT-C P
S BOM1
K DOWN ENTER
S PART3
K ALT-C P END
S BOM3END
K ENTER
S PART16
K ESC
S BACK3
K ESC
S BACK1
K ESC DOWN ENTER ALT-C P
S BOM20
K ESC ESC ESC
